2", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "coastal   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "talking about the area next to the ocean", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Their main breeding ground is coastal Argentina.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "colony ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large number of animals ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can see large colonies of penguins.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "threatened  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in danger of disappearing ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Penguins are considered a threatened species.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cute  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pretty ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The penguins are cute!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "oil ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "liquid made from petroleum ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Penguins are threatened because of oil.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Showing Interest and Surprise", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use these phrases and techniques to show interest and surprise in conversation:", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: There are penguins in Argentina.<br><span class=\"strong\">Tourist</span>: Oh, really? How interesting!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Use rising intonation (your voice goes up) to show interest.</li><li> Use falling intonation (your voice goes down) to show surprise. </li><li>Use these techniques to keep the conversation going.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Showing Interest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Showing Surprise\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Oh?<br> Oh, yeah?<br> Really?<br> Oh, really?<br> Is that right?<br> How fascinating/interesting!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Wow!<br> Amazing!<br> Get out of here!<br> Unbelievable!<br> No!<br> Who would have guessed?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online and research an animal that lives in another country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find 5 facts about that animal.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write the information in a short paragraph (8-10 lines).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to your partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research about an animal from another country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write 8-10 lines about an animal from another country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph to my partner.", "type": "text"}]}]}